## Section 3: Multiply and Divide Rational Numbers
15. **$1.2$**
    *Step-by-step:* $(-0.75) \times (-1.6) = 1.2$. Negative times negative is positive.

16. **$-8$**
    *Step-by-step:* $-2.5 \times 3.2 = -8$.

17. **$-\frac{3}{4}$**
    *Step-by-step:* $-\frac{5}{6} \times \frac{9}{10} = -\frac{45}{60} = -\frac{3}{4}$.

18. **$-3$**
    *Step-by-step:* $4.5 \div (-1.5) = -3$.

